{"chunk_id": "d6aebd604ede", "text": "Kadru and Vinata discover the celestial horse whose white body has black hairs in its tail, proving Kadru\u2019s claim and forcing the sorrowful Vinata into slavery after losing their wager. Soon after, Vinata\u2019s son Garuda bursts from his egg in overwhelming radiance, blazing like cosmic fire and expanding to colossal size as he ascends the sky. The gods, terrified by the brilliance, mistake him for a consuming flame until Agni explains that this being is Garuda, son of Kasyapa and destined foe of the Nagas. The gods praise him with a vast hymn, and Garuda mercifully reduces his blazing form. He then departs, carrying his brother Aruna and placing him in the eastern sky just as the sun prepares to rise.\nKadru enslaves Vinata after winning the horse wager, while the newly born Garuda dazzles the gods, calms them, and departs carrying Aruna eastward.\nThemes: birth of Garuda, divine power revealed, slavery of Vinata, cosmic awe, gods seeking protection", "vector": [0.01799202151596546, -0.02096814475953579, 0.0005664781201630831, -0.01342637650668621, -0.011403964832425117, -0.0010610895697027445, -0.02650102972984314, -0.016842154785990715, -0.025594664737582207, -0.026000499725341797, 0.0034935635048896074, 0.014853563159704208, 0.0017349448753520846, -9.126004442805424e-05, 0.006266769953072071, 0.012391497381031513, 0.031844522804021835, -0.023213766515254974, 0.026230473071336746, -0.018546663224697113, -0.013453432358801365, 0.011972134001553059, -0.024431271478533745, 0.02230740152299404, -0.007298266980797052, 0.028489621356129646, 0.017423851415514946, -0.02264559641480446, 0.02271323651075363, -0.014177171513438225, -0.0033735039178282022, -0.008150520734488964, -0.00013559541548602283, -0.0009799225954338908, -0.007223864085972309, 0.0016689966432750225, 0.0019784460309892893, -0.003476653713732958, 0.0036964809987694025, -0.00115324801299721, 0.009564179927110672, -0.013609002344310284, -0.0045284428633749485, 0.